<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Centennial Celebration</title>
<meta name="claude:viewport-fit-sides" content="cover">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Figtree:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Young+Serif&display=swap">
<style>
/* Layout: single column, teal hero band with the time/place facts, then three "before the day" action cards, maps, flyer and videos. */
:root{
  --bg:#f5f8f7; --surface:#ffffff; --fg:#10272b; --muted:#4d6468; --line:#d3e0de;
  --teal:#0d7f86; --teal-deep:#08474d; --on-teal:#ffffff; --gold:#e3a72f; --gold-ink:#5a3f00;
  --display:'Young Serif', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
  --body:'Figtree', system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
  color-scheme: light;
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){
  :root:not([data-theme="light"]){
    --bg:#0c1a1c; --surface:#142a2d; --fg:#e7f1f0; --muted:#9db8ba; --line:#274347;
    --teal:#4cc3ca; --teal-deep:#06363b; --on-teal:#06222a; --gold:#f0bd54; --gold-ink:#f6d58e; color-scheme: dark;
  }
}
:root[data-theme="dark"]{
  --bg:#0c1a1c; --surface:#142a2d; --fg:#e7f1f0; --muted:#9db8ba; --line:#274347;
  --teal:#4cc3ca; --teal-deep:#06363b; --on-teal:#06222a; --gold:#f0bd54; --gold-ink:#f6d58e; color-scheme: dark;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--fg);font-family:var(--body);font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;margin:0}
a{color:var(--teal)}
:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--gold);outline-offset:3px;border-radius:4px}
.wrap{max-width:1040px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:max(16px,env(safe-area-inset-left,0px));padding-right:max(16px,env(safe-area-inset-right,0px))}
h1,h2,h3{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;line-height:1.12;text-wrap:balance;margin:0}
p{margin:0}

/* hero */
.hero{background:var(--teal-deep);color:#fff;padding-block:48px 40px}
:root:not([data-theme="light"]) .hero{color:var(--fg)}
@media (prefers-color-scheme: light){:root:not([data-theme="dark"]) .hero{color:#fff}}
:root[data-theme="light"] .hero{color:#fff}
.eyebrow{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:600;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:14px}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(40px,8vw,76px);max-width:14ch}
.hero .sub{margin-top:16px;max-width:52ch;font-size:19px;opacity:.92}
.facts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(200px,1fr));gap:12px;margin-top:32px}
.fact{border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.28);border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px}
.fact b{display:block;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:4px}
.fact span{font-family:var(--display);font-size:24px;line-height:1.2;display:block}
.fact small{display:block;font-size:14px;opacity:.85;margin-top:2px}
.countdown{margin-top:20px;font-size:15px;opacity:.9}

section{padding-block:48px}
section + section{border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.sec-head{margin-bottom:24px;max-width:60ch}
.sec-head h2{font-size:clamp(28px,4.5vw,40px)}
.sec-head p{margin-top:10px;color:var(--muted)}

/* steps */
.steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:16px;list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;counter-reset:s}
.step{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;min-width:0;counter-increment:s}
.step::before{content:counter(s);font-family:var(--display);font-size:20px;width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--teal);color:var(--on-teal);display:grid;place-items:center}
.step h3{font-size:23px}
.step p{color:var(--muted)}
.step .meta{font-weight:600;color:var(--fg)}
.btn{display:inline-block;margin-top:auto;align-self:flex-start;background:var(--gold);color:#2a1d00;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;padding:12px 20px;border-radius:8px}
.btn:hover{filter:brightness(1.06)}
.step .btn{margin-top:6px}
.shirt{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.swatch{width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;background:#1fa5a8;border:2px solid var(--line);flex:none}

/* maps */
figure{margin:0}
.mapbox{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:10px}
.mapbox img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:6px}
figcaption{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px;padding-inline:4px}
.legend{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(210px,1fr));gap:10px 20px;list-style:none;padding:0;margin:20px 0 0}
.legend li{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;font-size:15px}
.chip{width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:4px;flex:none;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.25)}
.note{margin-top:20px;padding:14px 16px;border-left:4px solid var(--gold);background:var(--surface);border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;max-width:70ch}

/* know before you go */
.kbyg{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,320px) minmax(0,1fr);gap:28px;align-items:start}
.kbyg a.thumb{display:block;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;background:var(--surface);padding:10px}
.kbyg img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;image-rendering:auto}
.kbyg ul{padding-left:20px;margin:12px 0 0;color:var(--muted)}
@media (max-width:700px){.kbyg{grid-template-columns:1fr}.kbyg a.thumb{max-width:320px}}

/* videos */
.videos{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:16px}
.vid{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:16px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--fg)}
.vid .screen{aspect-ratio:16/9;max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;background:var(--teal-deep);display:grid;place-items:center}
.vid .play{width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--gold);display:grid;place-items:center}
.vid .play::after{content:"";border-left:20px solid #2a1d00;border-top:12px solid transparent;border-bottom:12px solid transparent;margin-left:5px}
.vid:hover .play{transform:scale(1.06)}
.vid strong{font-size:18px}
.vid span.s{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:no-preference){.play{transition:transform .15s}}

footer{background:var(--teal-deep);color:#fff;padding-block:36px}
:root:not([data-theme="light"]) footer{color:var(--fg)}
@media (prefers-color-scheme: light){:root:not([data-theme="dark"]) footer{color:#fff}}
:root[data-theme="light"] footer{color:#fff}
footer a{color:var(--gold)}
footer p + p{margin-top:8px}
</style>

<header class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">Archdiocese of San Antonio · 1926 to 2026</div>
    <h1>Centennial Celebration</h1>
    <p class="sub">Join our parish at Nelson W. Wolff Stadium for the Centennial Mass and the proclamation of the new Pastoral Vision. Admission is free and everyone is welcome.</p>
    <div class="facts">
      <div class="fact"><b>Date</b><span>Saturday, Nov 7</span></div>
      <div class="fact"><b>Doors open</b><span>3:00 pm</span></div>
      <div class="fact"><b>Mass begins</b><span>4:00 pm</span></div>
      <div class="fact"><b>Place</b><span>Wolff Stadium</span><small>5757 US-90, San Antonio, TX 78227</small></div>
    </div>
    <p class="countdown" id="countdown" hidden></p>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
<section id="plan">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <h2>Get ready</h2>
      <p>Three things to take care of before Saturday.</p>
    </div>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li class="step">
        <h3>Reserve your seats</h3>
        <p>Register for the centennial celebration so your seats are saved.</p>
        <a class="btn" href="https://archsa.regfox.com/assembly2026" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Reserve seats</a>
      </li>
      <li class="step">
        <h3>Ride the parish bus</h3>
        <p>Want to ride to the celebration with the parish? Reserve your bus tickets. The bus leaves from the church.</p>
        <p class="meta">Departs at 2:30 pm</p>
        <a class="btn" href="https://pci.jotform.com/form/262943971308061" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Reserve bus tickets</a>
      </li>
      <li class="step">
        <h3>Wear your teal OLG T-shirt</h3>
        <p class="shirt"><span class="swatch" aria-hidden="true"></span>Pick up your shirt in the main campus pavilion next to the church.</p>
        <p class="meta">Sunday, November 1 · 10 am to 2 pm</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="parking">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <h2>Where to park</h2>
      <p>Enter through the entrance for reserved and general parking. Riding the parish bus? Look for the bus stop along the bottom of the map.</p>
    </div>
    <figure class="mapbox">
      <a href="#" ><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Aerial map of the Wolff Stadium parking lots: general parking, handicap parking, staff and volunteer parking, priests, senior staff, bishops and VIP lots, the bus stop and the entrance for reserved and general parking."></a>
      <figcaption>Nelson W. Wolff Stadium parking map. Pinch to zoom.</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <ul class="legend">
      <li><span class="chip" style="background:#f0e11c"></span>General parking</li>
      <li><span class="chip" style="background:#1fa6e6"></span>Handicap parking</li>
      <li><span class="chip" style="background:#c77fc0"></span>Staff and volunteer parking</li>
      <li><span class="chip" style="background:#4cae4c"></span>Parking for priests</li>
      <li><span class="chip" style="background:#e5199b"></span>Senior staff parking</li>
      <li><span class="chip" style="background:#e8800f"></span>VIP parking</li>
      <li><span class="chip" style="background:#2b3f8f"></span>Parking for bishops</li>
      <li><span class="chip" style="background:#d62828"></span>Bus stop</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="kbyg">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <h2>Know before you go</h2>
      <p>The official guide covers entry gates, screening, the bag policy, what to leave at home, and food, water and medications.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="kbyg">
      <a class="thumb" href="#"  aria-label="Open the Know Before You Go guide">
        <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Know Before You Go flyer for the Centennial Celebration at Wolff Stadium, covering arriving and entering, what to leave at home, and food, water and medications.">
      </a>
      <div>
        <p>Plan to arrive early, since doors open at 3:00 pm and screening happens at every gate.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>All entry gates are accessible.</li>
          <li>Check the bag policy before you pack.</li>
          <li>Leave restricted items at home.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="layout">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <h2>Inside the stadium</h2>
      <p>The layout for the three processions, with the main stage behind home plate and seating on the field.</p>
    </div>
    <figure class="mapbox">
      <a href="#" ><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Stadium field layout showing the main stage, choir stage, seminarian and field seating, and the three procession routes: pre-liturgical procession, procession of the Pastoral Vision, and liturgical procession line up."></a>
      <figcaption>1. Pre-liturgical procession · 2. Procession of the Pastoral Vision · 3. Liturgical procession line up. Priests exit from the dugout. Pinch to zoom.</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="videos">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <h2>Watch</h2>
      <p>Two videos about the celebration. They open on YouTube.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="videos">
      <a class="vid" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TQlAMNv1D6Q" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <div class="screen"><div class="play"></div></div>
        <strong>Centennial video 1</strong><span class="s">Watch on YouTube</span>
      </a>
      <a class="vid" href="https://youtu.be/xBdDQHkp_I0" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <div class="screen"><div class="play"></div></div>
        <strong>Centennial video 2</strong><span class="s">Watch on YouTube</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</main>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap">
    <p><strong>Saturday, November 7 · Doors 3:00 pm · Mass 4:00 pm</strong></p>
    <p>Nelson W. Wolff Stadium, 5757 US-90, San Antonio, TX 78227</p>
    <p>Looking for something not listed here? Visit the Archdiocese of San Antonio at <a href="https://www.archsa.org/assembly" target="_blank" rel="noopener">archsa.org/assembly</a>.</p>
  </div>
</footer>

<script>
(function(){
  try{
    var el=document.getElementById('countdown');
    var now=new Date();
    var ev=new Date(2026,10,7,16,0,0);
    var today=new Date(now.getFullYear(),now.getMonth(),now.getDate());
    var day=new Date(2026,10,7);
    var d=Math.round((day-today)/86400000);
    var t=null;
    if(d>1)t=d+' days to go';
    else if(d===1)t='Tomorrow is the big day';
    else if(d===0)t='Today is the day';
    if(t){el.textContent=t;el.hidden=false;}
  }catch(e){}
})();
</script>

</html>
